					"local_notes": "Lore: A silent, mind-shattering shout that stuns everyone nearby.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10/level, delivering the default Stun effect) with Area Effect (+50%) plus Warp Sorcery/Perils, net +20%. Full modified cost: 10 x 1.2 = 12 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20).",
